  "description": "High-performance streaming hash library for .NET 10. All 71 algorithms fully accessible including MurmurHash3, CityHash, SpookyHash, SipHash, FarmHash, HighwayHash, MetroHash, KangarooTwelve, wyhash, xxHash, plus complete cryptographic suite (SHA-3, BLAKE, Keccak, RIPEMD, Whirlpool, Tiger, GOST, Streebog, Skein, SM3, Grøstl, JH). Features unified HashFacade API with comprehensive test coverage (752+ tests).",
