  "releaseNotes": "v1.6.1: Major memory optimization for JH and Grøstl algorithms. JH memory reduced 99.99% (6.6MB to 512B per hash). Grøstl memory reduced 99.91% (817KB to 752B per hash). Pre-allocated buffers eliminate per-block allocations in hot paths. 752 tests passing. All 71 algorithms validated.",
